1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,380
He fixed my engine for free.

2
00:00:02,380 --> 00:00:05,270
Then he tore a page out of my logbook.

3
00:00:05,870 --> 00:00:07,027
Ohio, 1996.

4
00:00:07,027 --> 00:00:09,762
One year behind the wheel.

5
00:00:09,762 --> 00:00:11,130
Running late.

6
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:14,870
He worked under that hood for two hours.

7
00:00:14,870 --> 00:00:15,890
Not one word.

8
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:18,398
Then he picked up my log.

9
00:00:18,398 --> 00:00:19,466
Read one page.

10
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:20,840
And ripped it out.

11
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,960
"Write it true," he said,
"or don't write it."

12
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,980
He wouldn't take a dime.

13
00:00:26,580 --> 00:00:30,270
Thirty years later, there's
not one false line in my log.

14
00:00:30,870 --> 00:00:32,460
Full story's on the channel.

15
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:35,380
And I still don't know why that old man...
